                                                "sense_id": "9ac29932-08bc-3950-ac24-dce7516468a0",
                                                "text": ", \"A Funeral Sermon\"\nIt [a little brook] paid to its common audit no more than the revenues of a little cloud."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "695b7e4a-6c00-3173-a411-80b428a84a41",
